Building
========

OpenCV 5, yyjson 0.12, and inih 61 are not taken from Debian. Build
them first:

  export HOWDY_DEPS_PREFIX=/opt/howdy-next-deps
  ./scripts/build-opencv5.sh
  ./scripts/build-yyjson.sh
  ./scripts/build-inih.sh

Then overlay debian/ onto an upstream howdy-next tree and run
dpkg-buildpackage. CI does this via scripts/ci-build.sh.
